{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜大致天晴最高氣溫30度　未來一兩日風勢較大\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORCAST-261026-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】東北季候風正為廣東沿岸帶來大致晴朗的天氣。本港今日(10月26日)天氣預測，大致天晴。日間市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩東至東北風。</p><p>展望未來一兩日風勢較大，部分時間有陽光。本周後期天晴，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.700724+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:18:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T20:18:09.764063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:14:00.733618+00:00","content_hash":"b7b06d89a16b18eacad0edfc61d0677f5035847575d911451277c662a8b62eb5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.700724+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}